    "fix": "The client sent redirect_uri with a trailing slash (/callback/), but only /callback is registered. Exact string matching is required. Pick one form and use it everywhere. Either change the app to send https://app.example.com/callback, or register the trailing-slash form on the client. Send the identical value in both the authorize and token requests. Don't switch to wildcard or loose redirect matching.",
